ation-tested here.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"selectedTaskId\": \"T2\",\n  \"requestedStatus\": \"completed\",\n  \"progressNote\": \"Added automatic rollback for records created in the current Testify run, persisted create metadata early so downstream failures can be rolled back and cleared, and unified cleanup/rollback delete handling so HTTP 404 is treated as success without clearing metadata on failed deletes.\",\n  \"validationRan\": [\n    \"dotnet test .\\\\FoToolbox.sln -c Release --filter Category=Testify\",\n    \"dotnet test tests/FoToolbox.Tests/FoToolbox.Tests.csproj -c Release --filter \\\"FullyQualifiedName~Testify\\\" -a x86\"\n  ],\n  \"blocker\": \"The repo's exact x64 test validation is blocked locally because Microsoft.AspNetCore.App 8.0 x64 is not installed; the x86 fallback passed.\",\n  \"needsHumanReview\": false\n}\n```\n"}
